{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-3374","published":"2026-08-13T14:02:01Z","modified":"2026-08-16T01:45:17.693977402Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-48829","CVE-2026-56968"],"summary":"libgsasl security update","details":"The library includes support for the SASL framework and at least partial support for the CRAM-MD5, EXTERNAL, GSSAPI, ANONYMOUS, PLAIN, SECURID, DIGEST-MD5, LOGIN, and NTLM mechanisms.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nIn GNU SASL before 2.2.3, DIGEST-MD5 has a NULL pointer dereference affecting both clients and servers, via a known token with no accompanying = character. This occurs in lib/digest-md5/getsubopt.c.(CVE-2026-48829)\n\nGNU SASL before 2.2.4 lacks sanitization of a short challenge in _gsasl_ntlm_client_step in the NTLM client, which could result in memory disclosure via a crafted server.(CVE-2026-56968)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libgsasl","ecosystem":"openEuler:20.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/libgsasl&distro=openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.8.1-3.oe2003sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["libgsasl-1.8.1-3.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","libgsasl-debuginfo-1.8.1-3.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","libgsasl-debugsource-1.8.1-3.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","libgsasl-devel-1.8.1-3.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm"],"src":["libgsasl-1.8.1-3.oe2003sp4.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["libgsasl-1.8.1-3.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","libgsasl-debuginfo-1.8.1-3.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","libgsasl-debugsource-1.8.1-3.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","libgsasl-devel-1.8.1-3.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-3374.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.openeuler.org/zh/security/security-bulletins/detail/?id=openEuler-SA-2026-3374"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-48829"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-56968"}],"database_specific":{"severity":"High"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V3","score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H"}]}